{
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/43": "\\c[52]敏捷\\c[0]越高，\r\n连击率与回避率就越高，\r\n行动速度也会提升。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/44": "而\\c[52]生命\\c[0]会减少受到的伤害，\r\n并提高HP的自然恢复速度。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/46": "\\c[52]意志\\c[0]能提升魔法效果和暴击率。\r\n枪械等部分特殊武器的威力\r\n取决于意志，而非力量。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/47": "最后是\\c[52]魅力\\c[0]，\r\n它会提高同伴的攻击力，\r\n似乎还能降低向你出售的商品价格。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/48": "想斜向移动时，\r\n按住\\my[-5]\\sysS[75]\\my[-5]再移动即可。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/49": "按住\\my[-4]\\sysS[73]\\my[-4]移动，\r\n就能进入\\c[52]冲刺模式\\c[0]，高速移动。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/50": "需要谨慎行动时，或想快速推进时，\r\n请分别灵活运用这些操作。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/51": "按\\my[-5]\\sysS[79]\\my[-5]\r\n可以打开快捷栏。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/52": "设置或取消\\c[52]快捷栏项目\\c[0]时，\r\n按\\my[-5]\\sysS[74]\\my[-5]打开菜单，\r\n选择物品或技能，再按\\my[-5]\\sysS[70]\\my[-5]。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/53": "经常使用的技能和物品\r\n最好登记到快捷栏。\r\n建议术士登记“集中”等技能。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/54": "食物能大幅恢复\\c[52]EN\\c[0]。\r\n但许多食物随身携带后会腐败，\r\n长期保存很危险。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/55": "哪些食物会腐败全看运气。\r\n有些能撑过整段旅途，\r\n有些则会立刻腐坏。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/56": "食物种类不同，腐败概率也不同。\r\n例如\\c[52]生肉\\c[0]\r\n就是非常容易腐坏的食物。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/57": "食物腐坏后，EN恢复量会降低，\r\n还会导致\\c[52]食物中毒\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/58": "吃下的腐坏食物越多，\r\n食物中毒效果就越严重，\r\n大量食用非常危险。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/59": "说起来，把食物交给\\c[52]协力NPC\\c[0]携带时，\r\n不知为何就不会腐坏。\r\n这是为什么呢？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/60": "如彩虹般闪耀的美丽石头——\r\n\\c[52]梦幻石\\c[0]……\r\n对老朽这样的人来说，它只是宝石而已。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/61": "但对勇者\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]而言，\r\n它似乎另有意义。收集后，\r\n据说能给这座城堡带来变化……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/62": "梦幻石能在世界各地找到，\r\n有时会作为宝石出售，\r\n强大的怪物也经常携带。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/63": "还能用梦幻石增加\\c[52]城堡居民\\c[0]，\r\n让他们在冒险中助你一臂之力。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/64": "其中或许还会出现能指引你\r\n踏上新\\c[52]旅途目标\\c[0]的居民。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/65": "若完成那些旅途，\r\n或许能为\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]带来\r\n新的可能性。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_30_soldier_a_ev_talk.txt/0": "什、什么？！城堡里有僵尸？！\r\n……啊，原来是\\c[50]\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]\\c[0]。\r\n抱歉，无论过多久我都还是不太习惯。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_30_soldier_a_ev_talk.txt/1": "哎呀呀，女王陛下！\r\n您这就要启程了吗。\r\n那么，请容小人略作建议。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_30_soldier_a_ev_talk.txt/2": "啊！\\c[50]\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]\\c[0]……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_30_soldier_a_ev_talk.txt/3": "\\c[52]木箱\\c[0]和\\c[52]宝箱\\c[0]等，\r\n都可以通过攻击破坏，\r\n从中取得物品。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_30_soldier_a_ev_talk.txt/4": "此外！若能使用\\c[52]开锁\\c[0]技能，\r\n就能更顺利地\r\n取出其中的物品！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_311_fari_ev_find.txt/0": "要不要使用配发给骑士的武具？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_311_fari_ev_talk.txt/0": "怪物？！……咦，国王的孩子？\r\n……哎？\r\n原、原来如此……究竟发生了什么。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_311_fari_ev_talk.txt/1": "算了，如果你愿意，\r\n要不要买下我手上的武器？\r\n我觉得都很好用。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_311_fari_ev_talk.txt/2": "哎呀，女王陛下和妖精小姐，你们好。\r\n其实我从骑士那里买了太多武器，\r\n现在行李都装满了……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_311_fari_ev_talk.txt/3": "你的行李还有空间吗？\r\n愿意的话，能买下这些武器吗？\r\n我可不会把差东西强卖给你。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_311_fari_ev_talk.txt/4": "哎呀，勇者和妖精小姐，你们好。\r\n其实我从骑士那里买了太多武器，\r\n现在行李都装满了……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_311_fari_ev_talk.txt/5": "你的行李还有空间吗？\r\n愿意的话，能买下这些武器吗？\r\n我觉得都很好用。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_311_fari_ev_talk.txt/6": "谢谢。\r\n愿您平安完成使命，\r\n我会为您祈祷。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_311_fari_ev_talk.txt/7": "那么，一路顺风。\r\n使命虽然艰巨，也要加油哦。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_312_grande_ev_find.txt/0": "需要骑士的防具吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_312_grande_ev_talk.txt/0": "……原来康拉斯王的孩子是僵尸，\r\n这传闻是真的。不，失礼了，\r\n请原谅我投来好奇的目光。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_312_grande_ev_talk.txt/1": "我是Grande。身为骑士侍奉国王，\r\n也负责管理配发的防具。\r\n你需要防具吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_312_grande_ev_talk.txt/2": "女王陛下要往东去吗。\r\n我是骑士Grande，\r\n负责管理城堡配发的防具。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_312_grande_ev_talk.txt/3": "若你愿意，就把这件防具\r\n带走吧。\r\n当然，是要收费的。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_312_grande_ev_talk.txt/4": "要出发了吗？我差点没认出来，\r\n勇者。我是Grande，身为骑士侍奉国王，\r\n也负责管理配发的防具。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_312_grande_ev_talk.txt/5": "怎么样？如果有需要，\r\n就把这件防具带走吧。\r\n当然，费用还是要收的。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_312_grande_ev_talk.txt/6": "希望能对你有些帮助。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_313_meat_eater_ev_find.txt/0": "我已经不能再为<PLAYER>\r\n做饭了吗……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_313_meat_eater_ev_talk.txt/0": "就算你变成了僵尸，\r\n颜色或气味异常的食物，\r\n也请绝对不要吃。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_313_meat_eater_ev_talk.txt/1": "颜色或气味异常的食物，\r\n请绝对不要吃。\r\n纳尤塔果直接吃也很美味哦。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_313_meat_eater_ev_talk.txt/2": "啊，<PLAYER>……就算成了僵尸，\r\n你也一直愿意吃我做的菜。\r\n真担心你旅途上的饮食。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_313_meat_eater_ev_talk.txt/3": "啊，女王陛下！直到最后\r\n都无法再照料您的饮食，\r\n我实在深感遗憾……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_313_meat_eater_ev_talk.txt/4": "<PLAYER>，您终于要启程了。\r\n我无法同行，恕我冒昧，\r\n真的很担心您旅途上的饮食。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_313_meat_eater_ev_talk.txt/5": "如果不嫌弃，请带上这块铁板。\r\n有了它，无论在哪里都能把肉烤得美味！\r\n……虽然有点重。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_313_meat_eater_ev_talk.txt/6": "获得了\\c[52]便携烤盘\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_313_meat_eater_ev_talk.txt/7": "那么，一路平安。\r\n请尽量不要生吃肉类。\r\n不仅难吃，还有食物中毒的危险。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_314_shout_root_ev_damage.txt/0": "嘎啊",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_314_shout_root_ev_damage.txt/1": "嘎啊　嘎啊",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_314_shout_root_ev_damage.txt/2": "不　要　不　要",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_314_shout_root_ev_damage.txt/3": "嘎啊嘎啊嘎啊嘎啊",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_314_shout_root_ev_damage.txt/4": "嘎……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_314_shout_root_ev_dead.txt/0": "啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊\r\n啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊\r\n啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_314_shout_root_ev_find.txt/0": "别　别　别　拔我！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_314_shout_root_ev_talk.txt/0": "蹦，蹦，蹦——！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_314_shout_root_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>一边摇着脑袋，\r\n一边愉快地跳着舞。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_315_drag_store_ev_find.txt/0": "若要踏上旅途，药品是必需品吧？\r\n要不要到我这里来一趟？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_315_drag_store_ev_talk.txt/0": "嗨，<PLAYER>，要分别了真遗憾。\r\n我真的很喜欢你。\r\n毕竟能当药物实验体的僵尸可不好找……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_315_drag_store_ev_talk.txt/1": "……咳哼！\r\n说起来，我有很多多余的药，\r\n愿意的话带一些走吧？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_315_drag_store_ev_talk.txt/2": "哎呀女王陛下，您看起来气色不错。\r\n愿您平安完成使命，\r\n我会为您祈祷。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_315_drag_store_ev_talk.txt/3": "所以，作为这趟使命之旅的陪伴，\r\n要不要带上我的药？\r\n其实只是我不小心做多了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_315_drag_store_ev_talk.txt/4": "嗨，<PLAYER>，要出发了吗？\r\n我有很多多余的药，\r\n愿意的话带一些走吧？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_315_drag_store_ev_talk.txt/5": "没什么，今天没有奇怪的东西。\r\n会爆炸的、会把周围变成火海的，\r\n那些危险玩意我自己留着。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_315_drag_store_ev_talk.txt/6": "好了，我也该离开城堡了。\r\n抱歉不能侍奉到最后，\r\n我可不想因为光之灾厄而死。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_315_drag_store_ev_talk.txt/7": "我还有好多没试验过的药……\r\n不对，世界上一定还有很多人\r\n能被我的药救下！再见！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_315_drag_store_ev_talk.txt/8": "好了，我也该离开城堡了。\r\n不能侍奉父亲到最后很抱歉，\r\n但我可不想因为光之灾厄而死。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_315_drag_store_ev_talk.txt/9": "我还有好多没试验过的药……\r\n不对，世界上一定还有很多人\r\n能被我的药救下！再见！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_find.txt/0": "要出发了吗？\r\n来吧，最后让我看看你的脸。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/0": "好，请轰轰烈烈地大干一场！\r\n千万别被那种光吞没。\r\n觉得不妙时，先撤退也没关系。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/1": "世界当然要拯救，\r\n但只要活着，就能再次挑战。\r\n……别死啊。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/2": "好，去轰轰烈烈地大干一场！\r\n别被那种光吞掉。\r\n觉得不妙时，就先撤退！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/3": "世界当然要拯救，\r\n但只要活着，就能再次挑战。\r\n……别死啊。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/4": "哟，<PLAYER>，你要去讨伐堕天使啊。\r\n……你的身体也许是怪物，\r\n但里面是不折不扣的勇者。我保证。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/5": "来吧殿下，请让我完成最后的工作。\r\n我会传授你一项我的技艺。\r\n虽然朴素，但很好用。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/6": "哟，女王陛下，要去讨伐堕天使吗。\r\n您一定没问题。\r\n我也能安心送您出征了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/7": "来吧陛下，请让我完成最后的工作。\r\n我会传授你一项我的技艺。\r\n虽然朴素，但很好用。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/8": "哟，<PLAYER>，你要去讨伐堕天使啊。\r\n真是的，你也长大了。\r\n不久前明明还是个小鬼！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/9": "来吧殿下，请让我完成最后的工作。\r\n我会传授你一项我的技艺。\r\n虽然朴素，但很好用。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/1852": "强力攻击（稍强攻击）_\\c[52]STR-2",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/1947": "\\c[17]强力攻击（稍强攻击）_\\c[52]STR-2\\c[2][能力不足]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/2186": "强力疾跑（短时间加速）_\\c[52]AGI-2\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/2278": "\\c[17]强力疾跑（短时间加速）_\\c[52]AGI-2\\c[2][能力不足]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/2492": "冥想（待机时提升自然恢复）_\\c[52]VIT-2\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/2585": "\\c[17]冥想（待机时提升自然恢复）_\\c[52]VIT-2\\c[2][能力不足]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/2789": "探知（得知下一座城镇或地下城的位置）_\\c[52]INT-2\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/2887": "\\c[17]探知（得知下一座城镇或地下城的位置）_\\c[52]INT-2\\c[2][能力不足]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/3096": "火花魔法（攻击眼前弱火）_\\c[52]WIL-2\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/3194": "\\c[17]火花魔法（攻击眼前弱火）_\\c[52]WIL-2\\c[2][能力不足]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/3403": "鼓舞（小幅强化自己与同伴）_\\c[52]CHR-2",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/3489": "\\c[17]鼓舞（小幅强化自己与同伴）_\\c[52]CHR-2\\c[2][能力不足]",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/10": "任何技艺的学习都需要\r\n消耗\\c[52]2点能力等级\\c[0]。\r\n也就是说，缺乏适性就无法掌握。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/11": "啊，原来如此，这项技艺目前\r\n不太适合陛下。\r\n……人生总会有这种时候。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/12": "啊，原来如此，这项技艺目前\r\n不太适合殿下。\r\n……别沮丧，再加强锻炼就好。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/13": "要学这项技艺啊，明白了！\r\n那就当作我最后的工作，\r\n请好好学下来！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/14": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了\r\n\\c[52]强力攻击\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/15": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了\r\n\\c[52]强力疾跑\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/16": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了\r\n\\c[52]冥想\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/17": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了\r\n\\c[52]探知\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/18": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了\r\n\\c[52]火花魔法\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_316_skill_trainer_castle_ev_talk.txt/19": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了\r\n\\c[52]鼓舞\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_317_white_owl_ev_darkness.txt/0": "呼……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_317_white_owl_ev_find.txt/0": "呼～\r\n（喂喂，那边的人）",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_317_white_owl_ev_talk.txt/86": "跟我来吧！（CHR_\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]→\\c[3]$tmp2\\c[0]）",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_317_white_owl_ev_talk.txt/178": "跟我来吧！（CHR_\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]→\\c[2]$tmp2\\c[0]_不足）",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_317_white_owl_ev_talk.txt/285": "不用了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_317_white_owl_ev_talk.txt/0": "呼，呼。\r\n（我是驮运猫头鹰。\r\n可以替你搬运一种物品）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_317_white_owl_ev_talk.txt/1": "呼呼，呼。\r\n（我也可以在战斗中略尽绵力。\r\n愿意带我一起走吗？）\r\n\\c[52][协力NPC，需要魅力等级2]",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_317_white_owl_ev_talk.txt/2": "呼呼！\r\n（我会帮上忙的！）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_317_white_owl_ev_talk.txt/3": "<TARGET>开始\r\n跟在你身后！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_317_white_owl_ev_talk.txt/4": "呼……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_317_white_owl_ev_talk.txt/5": "它不知何时警戒起来。\r\n看来你的魅力不够。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_318_white_owl_after_ev_damage.txt/0": "咳、咳！……呼……\r\n（……失礼，身体有点不舒服……）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_318_white_owl_after_ev_damage.txt/1": "呼、呼……呼！\r\n（唔……不不，\r\n我没事）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_318_white_owl_after_ev_damage.txt/2": "呼呼——！\r\n（我很精神）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_318_white_owl_after_ev_darkness.txt/0": "呼、呼——！\r\n（我讨厌这道光！）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_318_white_owl_after_ev_find.txt/0": "呼！呼！呼！\r\n（请不要丢下我）",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_318_white_owl_after_ev_talk.txt/131": "\\c[52]存取物品\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_318_white_owl_after_ev_talk.txt/272": "\\c[4]给予疗伤草_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2][浪费]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_318_white_owl_after_ev_talk.txt/392": "\\c[4]给予疗伤膏_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2][浪费]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_318_white_owl_after_ev_talk.txt/559": "给予疗伤草_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_318_white_owl_after_ev_talk.txt/670": "\\c[4]给予疗伤草_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_318_white_owl_after_ev_talk.txt/820": "给予疗伤膏_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_318_white_owl_after_ev_talk.txt/932": "\\c[4]给予疗伤膏_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_318_white_owl_after_ev_talk.txt/1041": "你还好吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_318_white_owl_after_ev_talk.txt/0": "看来现在不需要治疗。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_318_white_owl_after_ev_talk.txt/1": "你没有任何治疗物品！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_318_white_owl_after_ev_talk.txt/2": "呼呼呼——！\r\n（我非常精神）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_318_white_owl_after_ev_talk.txt/3": "呼……呼！\r\n（有点……不，我没事）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_318_white_owl_after_ev_talk.txt/4": "……呼……\r\n（我可能会死）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_318_white_owl_after_ev_talk.txt/5": "嘎吱嘎吱……\r\n呼！\r\n（这株草真厉害）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_318_white_owl_after_ev_talk.txt/6": "<TARGET>的HP\r\n恢复了50%！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_318_white_owl_after_ev_talk.txt/7": "舔舔舔舔……\r\n呼呼呼——！\r\n（感觉好多了）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_318_white_owl_after_ev_talk.txt/8": "<TARGET>的HP\r\n已完全恢复！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_319_rabbit_ev_find.txt/0": "！\r\n（喂喂，你听得到吗？）",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_319_rabbit_ev_talk.txt/93": "跟我来吧！（CHR_\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]→\\c[3]$tmp2\\c[0]）",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_319_rabbit_ev_talk.txt/184": "跟我来吧！（CHR_\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]→\\c[2]$tmp2\\c[0]_不足）",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_319_rabbit_ev_talk.txt/290": "不用了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_319_rabbit_ev_talk.txt/0": "！……、……！\r\n（我是驮运兔！\r\n能替你搬运4种物品！）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_319_rabbit_ev_talk.txt/1": "！！！\r\n（虽然不能战斗，\r\n但我会努力，带我一起走吧！）\r\n\\c[52][协力NPC，需要魅力等级2]",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_319_rabbit_ev_talk.txt/2": "……、……！\r\n（太好了！请多关照！\r\n我会跟在你身后的！）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_319_rabbit_ev_talk.txt/3": "<TARGET>开始\r\n跟在你身后！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_319_rabbit_ev_talk.txt/5": "它不知何时警戒起来。\r\n看来你的魅力不够。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_320_rabbit_after_ev_damage.txt/0": "唧！\r\n（好痛！）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_320_rabbit_after_ev_damage.txt/1": "……！！！\r\n（不要啦，住手啦）"
}
